  "body": "Retirement living is calling, and our owners are committed to selling. \r\n\r\nIdeal for families or downsizers seeking easy-care living with room for hobbies and visitors, this sunny, well-maintained three-bedroom, two-bathroom home sits on 600sqm of freehold land in a desirable Torbay street.\r\n\r\nDesigned for relaxed living, the kitchen, dining and living area opens directly to a lovely rear patio, creating an inviting setting for summer meals and entertaining. Easy-care gardens include a productive vegetable plot, with native bush providing a leafy backdrop. The upper deck offers another spot to unwind with a glass of wine as the sun goes down.\r\n\r\nA separate lounge can be closed off for movie nights or watching sport. Three bedrooms include a master with ensuite, complemented by a family bathroom and separate toilet.\r\n\r\nA double internal-access garage and loft storage accessed by attic stairs add everyday practicality. Extra parking at the front provides room for a boat or trailer, while an outdoor bench is handy for filleting fish or potting plants.\r\n\r\nWell maintained and updated, the home has an excellent building report available. The roof and exterior were painted in January 2025.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the excellent school zones, including Glamorgan School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College. Convenient to Northcross shops and East Coast Road, with access to motorway connections and Westfield Albany, this home has plenty to offer its next owners.\r\n\r\nOur owners are ready for their next chapter. Act quickly and make this home yours.\r\n\r\nDeadline sale closes 4pm, 9th December 2026, unless sold prior.",
